Source: byteguru
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ByteguruOS Team <devel@byteguru.example>
Installed-Size: 186
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1.0, gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0, libgtk4-layer-shell0, gsettings-desktop-schemas, adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu, byteguru-data, byteguru-apps-daemon, byteguru-compositor
Recommends: network-manager, upower, pipewire, power-profiles-daemon, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, thunar, foot
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: ByteguruOS desktop shell
 Panel (streams, window list, machine indicators, quick settings), application
 launcher, settings window, first-run wizard, lock screen, session entry
 (bgwl-session) and bgctl. The state model is separated from the widgets and
 unit-tested; the widgets read the compositor over its control socket instead
 of keeping a second copy of the truth.
